n—the Amazon, Assassin, Barbarian, Druid, Necromancer, Paladin, and Sorceress. Each is highly customizable with countless build and gear options for players to explore. \n\nDiablo® II: Resurrected can be played as a solo experience, or grab some friends and enjoy up to 8-player online multiplayer co-op. Then blow off some steam and claim a few ears by engaging in thrilling PvP duels outside of town.","ProductTitle":"Diablo® II: Resurrected™ PC","ShortTitle":"Diablo II: Resurrected","SortTitle":"Diablo 2","FriendlyTitle":null,"ShortDescription":"Evil has survived. Relive the epic adventure that defined the action RPG genre for decades.","SearchTitles":[{"SearchTitleString":"Diablo","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Diablo 2","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Diablo II","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Resurrected","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Remastered","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"D2R","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Blizzard","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"}],"VoiceTitle":"Diablo 2 Resurrected","RenderGroupDetails":null,"ProductDisplayRanks":[],"InteractiveModelConfig":null,"Interactive3DEnabled":false,"Language":"en","Markets":["US","DZ","AR","AU","AT","BH","BD","BE","BR","BG","CA","CL","CN","CO","CR","HR","CY","CZ","DK","EG","EE","FI","FR","DE","GR","GT","HK","HU","IS","IN","ID","IQ","IE","IL","IT","JP","JO","KZ","KE","KW","LV","LB","LI","LT","LU","MY","MT","MR","MX","MA","NL","NZ","NG","NO","OM","PK","PE","PH","PL","PT","QA","RO","RU","SA","RS","SG","SK","SI","ZA","KR","ES","SE","CH","TW","TH","TT","TN","TR","UA","AE","GB","VN","YE","LY","LK","UY","VE","AF","AX","AL","AS","AO","AI","AQ","AG","AM","AW","BO","BQ","BA","BW","BV","IO","BN","BF","BI","KH","CM","CV","KY","CF","TD","TL","DJ","DM","DO","EC","SV","GQ","ER","ET","FK","FO","FJ","GF","PF","TF","GA","GM","GE","GH","GI","GL","GD","GP","GU","GG","GN","GW","GY","HT","HM","HN","AZ"